# Zcash Ecosystem Digest | December 21, 2024

This week, we saw active discussions on future priorities for NU7, the development of the ZEC hardware wallet for encrypted storage, tips on how to publish apps anonymously, and a detailed look at integrating tools into the Zcash infrastructure. In addition, the community looked at potential ways to increase the privacy of digital currencies at the government level and considered the experience of using old Sprout addresses.

---

#### This Week’s Education Piece

The latest tutorial from **ZecHub** demonstrates how to scan the Zcash Network using a Zebra node and Ziggurat to attain an accurate node count and gather version information. Strengthen your understanding of Zcash’s network topology and help improve decentralization efforts.

